WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.605
Shelfmark keeps every link you save in one place.

2
00:00:02.605 --> 00:00:09.289
Open the demo: no account needed.

3
00:00:09.289 --> 00:00:13.595
Paste a link.

4
00:00:13.595 --> 00:00:18.001
The preview fills in by itself.

5
00:00:18.001 --> 00:00:21.010
Put it in a folder…

6
00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:24.088
…and give it a tag.

7
00:00:24.088 --> 00:00:29.275
Save it, and it lands on your shelf.

8
00:00:29.275 --> 00:00:32.963
Folders and tags keep the shelf in order.

9
00:00:32.963 --> 00:00:41.001
A tag gathers its links from every folder.

10
00:00:41.001 --> 00:00:42.529
Need it again? Press ⌘K.

11
00:00:42.529 --> 00:00:48.063
Search finds titles, notes, folders and tags.

12
00:00:48.063 --> 00:00:51.564
Shelfmark. Every link, back within reach.
